# Lesson 5, new exercise: Stayman over a 2NT opening, heart fit found.
title: Stayman over 2NT: a heart fit
id: L05-20
type: exercise
lesson: 5
concepts: 5.7
student: S
board: 41
dealer: N
vulnerable: EW

deal:            # spades  hearts  diamonds  clubs
  N  Q6     AK97   Q65    AKQJ
  E  A32    JT6    T983   965
  S  K75    8532   K72    843
  W  JT984  Q4     AJ4    T72

auction:
  N 2NT    = 21-22 points, balanced
  E Pass
  S 3C*    = Stayman: do you have a 4-card major?
     key: Four hearts, and 6 points is enough for game opposite 2NT. Ask first.
     not 3NT: You have four hearts. Look for the fit first.
     not Pass: 6 points opposite 21-22 is enough for game.
  W Pass
  N 3H     = Four hearts
  E Pass
  S 4H*    = Game in hearts
     key: An 8-card heart fit and enough for game: bid 4♥.
     not 3NT: You've found your heart fit. Play in hearts.
  W Pass
  N Pass
  E Pass

auction recap:
  You had four hearts, so you asked with 3♣. Partner had hearts too, and 4♥
  followed. North is declarer, because North bid hearts first, and so East
  will lead to the first trick.

play:
  1   E DT  S D2  W D4  N DQ
  2   N HA  E H6  S H2  W H4
      note: Draw trumps.
  3   N HK  E HT  S H3  W HQ
      note: Keep drawing trumps.
  4   N CA  E C5  S C3  W C2
      note: Run the clubs.
  5   N CK  E C6  S C4  W C7
      note: Keep going.
  6   N CQ  E C9  S C8  W CT
      note: And another club.
  7   N CJ  E HJ  S D7  W S4
      note: East's jack of hearts was always going to win a trick. Dummy throws a diamond.
  8   E SA  S S5  W S8  N S6
  9   E D9  S DK  W DA  N D5
  10  W DJ  N D6  E D3  S H5
      note: Dummy ruffs.
  11  S SK  W S9  N SQ  E S2
      note: Cash dummy's ♠K.
  12  S S7  W ST  N H7  E S3
      note: Declarer ruffs.
  13  N H9  E D8  S H8  W SJ
      note: 10 tricks: 4♥ made.

play recap:
  Declarer's plan: draw trumps, then run the clubs to throw away a losing
  diamond from dummy.

  4♥ made ten tricks. 3NT would have gone down, with only eight: the
  defenders would attack spades and diamonds, and there aren't nine tricks
  to take first. The 4-4 heart fit gave declarer trumps to stop that.
